    {
      "id": "1557201321650692127",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:22:06.483+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Alright, got to a place where I can sit and think for a moment. \nI'm still playing with a few things. \nThe triangle was an unfortunate inclusion. It's a *NON*shape meant to be nothing, but @Leo Moser (mole99) cannot verify nothing, only something, that was the something compromise. \n\nI'm playing with it a bit, but where I'm leaning is to have a qr looking shape in the bottom left, rocket stays where its at and that would have all 3 corners that are required to all be marked.",
